{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single tower crowned by a golden mountain rises above the dark plain. The rains are pouring down the cold walls, and in every peal of thunder you can hear the call of greedy bandits, ready to rush to the attack. Only you can stop the hordes of adventurers hungry for wealth, defend the tower with all possible methods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Defense is a &quot;tower defense&quot; where you set and upgrade traps, hire archers, stone throwers, and various mages to fend off waves of enemies. The gold earned from the destroyed bandits is spent on new structures and improvements, and various types of enemies force you to change tactics from level to level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art in a dark fantasy style with dynamic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night alternation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a good time</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete 1 wave!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3862930/10e6eb4b4aea71f82045b39ab4cda59c0ff5bc92.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 2 wave!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3862930/2665fdfdee2ebf6d4bbede188c4c5b96f8817b14.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 3 wave!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3862930/6373a77613f57082e8a9727f6b4d479ee49997ac.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 4 wave!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3862930/50f36e58219cdea544dde0780c8adf919ad59eb8.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 5 wave!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3862930/6686cf20864c1dc4f1e0240d48133f4a5de82fba.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862930?t=1760558410","background_raw":"https://store.